```console
$ scherzo-cloud organization audit list --help
List organization audit records

Usage: scherzo-cloud organization audit list [OPTIONS] <ORGANIZATION>

Arguments:
  <ORGANIZATION>  Organization ID or exact slug

Options:
      --limit <LIMIT>        Maximum audit records to return (1-100)
      --cursor <CURSOR>      Opaque continuation cursor
      --json                 Print the organization result as JSON
      --allow-insecure-http  Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                 Print help

Authorization:
  Only an active organization owner can list audit records.

Pagination:
  This command returns one page. Pass --cursor <CURSOR> to continue.

Privacy:
  Records with unavailable details retain only record, occurrence, and retention metadata.
  The command does not infer actor, action, or target details.

```
